"""omb: command line for omega-bridge-kit.

Host infrastructure only (CLI, test harness, UI glue). omb never converts anything itself:
.om -> C/Python/native/wasm runs the pinned Omega tools on the Spark over ssh, C/Python -> .om runs
the lifter (Omega source src/lift.om, shipped as its toc output gen/lift.c and gen/lift.py) on this Mac.

  omb setup                         install/verify the pinned tools on the Spark (ssh)
  omb pins                          print local PINS and what the Spark has installed
  omb convert FROM TO FILE          FROM c|py|om, TO om|c|py|native|wasm; result on stdout
  omb run FILE [--fn NAME] ARGS...  run every form of one function on ARGS, compare
  omb roundtrip FILE                bridge(lift(bridge X)) == bridge X, for C and Python
  omb verify [--quick] [FILE...]    full matrix over picks/ and samples/ plus a negative control

Global options: --json (JSONL records on stdout), --fresh (ignore the conversion cache).
Environment: OMB_SPARK (ssh host, default spark), OMB_WORK (scratch, default .omb/ in the kit).
Exit: 0 PASS, 1 mismatch or unexpected refusal, 2 something NOT_RUN, 3 negative control not
caught, 64 usage, 65 setup/pin problem.
"""
